  Hypothesis UNW' : rw_cells asegs m' (TH + 3168) [C1 (b8 0)].
  Hypothesis CST' : junk m' (TH + 2768) 32.
  Hypothesis TQ' : rw_cells asegs m' (TH + OT_TQ)
